@startuml 01_-_deployment
title 01 - deployment: Mac, tailnet, k3s on the lubuntu laptop
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members
node "Mac dev michaels-macbook-air 100.125.162.30 - opencode + Playwright MCP" as n0
node "Tailscale tailnet taila0a683.ts.net - overlay net for laptop and pod" as n1
node "lubuntu laptop mstro-travelmate-p215-52 - Ubuntu 22.04.5, 4 vCPU / 7.8 GB, 100.94.153.31" as n2
node "k3s v1.36.5+k3s1 single node - containerd 2.3.4, no registry, docker save | k3s ctr import" as n3
node "finder :8081 (Deployment, ns campaign) - discovery, dedupe, eligibility, CV score, produce" as n4
node "apply-worker (Deployment, ns campaign) - consumer group apply-workers, APPLY_MODE=shadow" as n5
node "campaign-api :8080 (NodePort 30080, ns campaign) - /stats /jobs /applications" as n6
node "kafka (StatefulSet, apache/kafka:3.7.1) - KRaft, single broker, heap 512 MB, campaign.jobs (3) + dlq (1)" as n7
node "mongo-0 mongo:7 (StatefulSet) - replica set rs0, auth, WiredTiger cache 256 MB" as n8
node "msrouter :3000 (Deployment, ns campaign) - PAUSED, replicas 0 since 2026-10-08" as n9
node "lubuntu-agent (Pod, ns default) - Chrome on Xvfb :99, VNC :5900, CDP :9222, sshd :22" as n10
node "hostPath /home/mstro/k3s-pod-data - mongodb, kafka, agent-home, agent-state, playwright-output, tailscale, usr-local" as n11
n0 --> n1 : ssh -p 2222 / 30022
n1 --> n2 : tailnet 100.94.153.31
n2 --> n3 : images imported into containerd
n3 --> n4 : Deployment
n3 --> n5 : Deployment
n3 --> n6 : NodePort 30080
n3 --> n9 : 0/0 replicas
n3 --> n10 : pod in ns default
n3 --> n7 : StatefulSet
n3 --> n8 : StatefulSet
n4 --> n7 : produce campaign.jobs
n7 --> n5 : consume apply-workers
n5 --> n8 : record after write
n6 --> n8 : read
n5 --> n10 : CDP :30922
n8 --> n11 : data
n7 --> n11 : data
note as guide
  Reading guide
  One k3s node runs ns campaign (finder, apply-worker, campaign-api,
  kafka-0, mongo-0, msrouter) and ns default (lubuntu-agent).
  Images are built on the host with docker and imported with
  k3s ctr images import; there is no registry.
  msrouter is pinned to 0 replicas and finder runs with
  FINDER_SCORING_ENABLED=false while the pipeline is paused.
  apply-worker reaches Chrome over CDP at the node IP
  port 30922 (NodePort 9222:30922).
  Host data lives under /home/mstro/k3s-pod-data, owned by mstro.
  The laptop host sshd does not auto-start after a reboot.
end note

@enduml
